# Pearson Edexcel International A-Level Biology

## Specification and Examination Guide

Qualification:
- International Advanced Subsidiary Biology (XBI11)
- International Advanced Level Biology (YBI11)

Specification:
- First teaching: September 2018
- Specification Issue 2: February 2021
- First examinations: 2019 onwards

This document summarises the official specification for
revision, examination preparation and AI-assisted marking.

It does not replace the complete Pearson specification.

---

# 1. Qualification Structure

The qualification is modular.

International Advanced Subsidiary (IAS):
- Unit 1
- Unit 2
- Unit 3

International Advanced Level (IAL):
- Units 1–6

All units are externally assessed through written examinations.

## Assessment Table

| Unit | Paper | Duration | Marks | IAL Weight |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | WBI11/01 | 1h 30m | 80 | 20% |
| 2 | WBI12/01 | 1h 30m | 80 | 20% |
| 3 | WBI13/01 | 1h 20m | 50 | 10% |
| 4 | WBI14/01 | 1h 45m | 90 | 20% |
